# docs/ is where the design notes and specs live. doc/ is published: pub.dev
# renders only README, CHANGELOG and LICENSE, but what rides in the archive is
# there for whoever opens the package, and a link from the readme reaches it.
# What `dart doc` generates under doc/api/ is kept out of git instead.
